  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Duffey described artificial intelligence as a key enabler and said adversaries are embracing it, so the U.S. must move quickly to apply it operationally. He cited opportunities for AI in internal Pentagon operations, AI-enabled design, and resource optimization, while noting that applying AI responsibly in deployment and operations is an area where he has less visibility and expertise. He also identified AI vulnerabilities requiring continued updates from companies and, in a March 4, 2026 statement, described AI-powered LYNX as helping small businesses reduce barriers to defense work.",
   "sids": [
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4",
    "s1",
    "s5"
   ],
   "sentences": [
